cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of Theorem 1.1 of "A solution to the
  inverse generator problem and related questions"
message: >-
  If you use this formalization, please cite both the software
  and the accompanying paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Emiel
    family-names: Lorist
  - given-names: Martin
    family-names: Meyries
  - given-names: Mark
    family-names: Veraar
abstract: >-
  A self-contained, machine-checked Lean 4 / Mathlib proof of
  Theorem 1.1 of arXiv:2608.06272v2: for every alpha in (0,1) the
  explicit 2n x 2n matrices A_n built from fractional Toeplitz
  matrices and a doubly exponential eigenvalue sequence generate
  exponentially stable semigroups whose inverse generators have
  norm growth of order n^alpha, with the absolute constant C = 50.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalization
  - inverse generator problem
  - C0-semigroup
  - Schauder basis
  - Toeplitz matrix
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: 'https://github.com/zoowirt/inverse-generator-lean'
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    A solution to the inverse generator problem and related
    questions
  authors:
    - given-names: Emiel
      family-names: Lorist
